+        // IEEE 802.11 cipher suites (OUI 00-0F-AC). Suite types per IEEE 802.11-2020 Table 9-149.
+        { wfa_map::tlvAkmSuiteCapabilities::eAkmSuiteOUI::IEEE80211,
