+                        //                                 batch API emits it verbatim.
+                        //   * has_rsn_override == false → security_ies is empty; the batch API
+                        //                                 emits a zero-length SecurityIEs payload
+                        //                                 as an explicit CLEAR signal so the
+                        //                                 Agent wipes rsn_override_* on this BSS.
+                        //
+                        // The bml_update_rsn workflow must communicate RSN state (SET or CLEAR)
+                        // for every BSS that appears in the UCI wireless config; otherwise BSSes
+                        // whose rsn_override_* options were emptied would be silently omitted
+                        // from the RSN TLV and the Agent's hostapd.conf / UCI would stay stale.
+                        cfg.emit_rsn_entry = true;
